  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in faith and comfort with this inspiring personalized blanket from Jeminise. Designed specifically for Christian women, this unique blanket combines uplifting messages with a soft, cozy feel, making it a perfect keepsake or a thoughtful gift for any occasion.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Unique Gift for Christian Women:</strong> A perfect personalized gift that combines faith, love, and comfort, making it an ideal keepsake.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Customization:</strong> Add a custom name or text to create a one-of-a-kind, meaningful gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Inspirational Christian Design:</strong> Features faith-based messages and uplifting Christian themes, providing daily encouragement and spiritual inspiration.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Perfect for Any Occasion:</strong> A thoughtful gift for birthdays, Christmas, Valentine's Day, New Year, or special milestones.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made with a soft Polyester fabric, ideal for all seasons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care Instructions:</strong> Easy to care for with hand wash only.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Christian I Am Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christian</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small, Medium, Large, X-Large</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>60\